report={'review':'Independent Validator Mode A contract129 revision2; static only','feature':'129','contract_id':'129','reviewer':'/root/validator133','revision_reviewed':1,'attempt':2,'limit':3,'root_release':release,'reviewed_commit':proposal,'proposal_sha256':sha(raw),'workspace':'/home/cnross/.tmp/nizam-129-mode-a2','branch':'review/129-mode-a2','prior_rejection':{'revision':'dde961943b1c79feadd0cc6aa99d64bb31770e6d','path':oldgate,'sha256':sha(oldraw),'disposition':'Original rejection/firstproposal/raw proof remain immutable; revised classification fixes the absent-backend semantic-red contradiction.'},'observations':['New explicit red_admission is a feasible capability-admission deficiency against the actual stub-only baseline: supported independent selector first proves direct realSBCL arithmetic42/freshnonce, actual defaultstub nonce dispatch and inherited fourteen-leaf core positives. An otherwise-valid paired fresh open request differs only by runtime=sbcl; current closed optional-key parser produces product64/okfalse/errorusage before endpoint/dispatch. Dedicated selector assertion1 is separately captured; it establishes no baseline SBCL/deep-semantic execution. Static review confirms this path, not an observed runtime result.','All unrelated CLI/check/source/dependency/host/control/timeout/malformed-request errors remain infrastructure or unexpected, never intended red. Exact product/selector exits, request/response and candidate/runner/control identities must be retained and Root-admitted; changed baseline outcome stops classification. No forged receipts, fallback, product monkeypatch, copied backend or pre-red Source checkpoint is authorized.','Same frozen procedural control must turn0 after actual correlated SBCL open/evaluate42/freshnonce/poll/close with backend/process identity. All seven original feature acceptance leaves remain mandatory; deep executable negatives on disposable candidates require realSBCL progress and paired positives, preserve original failures before subsequent repairs, and cannot become accepted product. Tests remain independently authored/frozen/reviewed before any product edit.','Exact seven acceptance commands match unchanged featurelist; added sbcl-admission is one procedural control, not replaced coverage. Eleven final commands include that green control, inherited core-ready and both compliance modes, followed by exactlyone freshQA extra. Independent ModeB, freshQA and Root evidence gates remain separate.','Product files remain only runtime_session.py plus new sbcl_session_loop.lisp; Evaluator owns runner changes. Implementation obligations and budget are byte-equivalent parsed values to prior proposal. Existing expressionstring/condition_ref/before_unwind/cancelled/image_consistency record vocabulary supports planned behavior; runtime selector is private controller metadata, with no schema/stub-fixture/harness/workflow/installed expansion authorized.','Core owner/generation/lease/attempt/busy/transport/atomicity, pre-unwind capture, bounded hostile reporting, partial-image quarantine, wait/reattach and observed owned-group termination obligations remain. No130hermeticASDF,131sixthjob/fullmatrix or132readiness scope is imported.','Both renewed precode approvals and bundle review, explicit020activation/allocation, actual narrow red and105clean normalmerge precede product editing; newintegration waits105mainallfive. Root alone owns approval/counters/lifecycle. Existing021failed3024/2600 exception and020proposed7350/9555/process3750/1292100 remain unallocated/nontransferable; all preparation charged once.','New attempt-owned independent clone has literalHTTPS.git origin and exact release/counter2/3. Contract remains proposed. No product/test/source import, runtime/preflight/acceptance probe, SBCL installation, CI, scope measurement, Rootstate or installed edit was performed.'], 'evidence':{'static_frame':'/home/cnross/.tmp/nizam-129-mode-a2-static/review.execution.json','static_stdout':'/home/cnross/.tmp/nizam-129-mode-a2-static/review.stdout.txt','controller_sha256':sha(source),'runner_sha256':sha((root/'tools/test_runtime_session.py').read_bytes()),'actual_counter_attempt':2,'diff_check_pid':p.pid,'diff_check_actual_exit':p.returncode},'final_verdict':{'approved':True,'summary':'Approve revised proposed129 contract: precise controlled admission-deficiency red is reachable without pretending the absent backend already demonstrates deep SBCL behavior; original scope and independent final acceptance remain.'},'issues':[],'missing_acceptance_coverage':[],'unsupported_claims':[]}
